#### From Quick Open (fastest for large projects)

¬TODO - add images etc

1. Press `Ctrl+P` (or `Cmd+P`).
2. Start typing the file name. VS Code searches across your entire open folder.
3. Use the arrow keys to highlight the file you want, then press Enter.

This is the quickest way to open a file when you already know its name. It works for any file type in your project.
